Ingelmec Takeoff (fork) — modifications
Copyright 2026 Ingelmec

This fork of OpenTakeoff is modified from the original
https://github.com/Kentucky-ai/opentakeoff. Changes by Ingelmec (as of
2026-10-11): Spanish UI translations; metric units as the
default; Ingelmec branding (logo, Inter/Open Sans typefaces); a default
condition pack by engineering discipline (NFPA 13 hazard areas, HVAC,
electrical, data/cabling, CCTV); prices/buy-list hidden by default
(pre-sale mode); deployment configuration for takeoff.ingelmec.app; removal of all outbound
links, third-party requests (webfonts, analytics, sign-in scripts) and the
original project's branding assets, with the Apache-2.0 attribution kept as
plain text in the app (Help > About and licenses) and in /licencias.html.
The full list of touched files lives in INGELMEC.md in this repository.
